      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait i already attached it to the execution role. i thought that's where the permissions went. so is it just a bucket policy thing? also i checked the public access stuff and it looks fine. any idea why it would still deny me if the policy i sent you is technically right for the resource?",
      "source": "evaluator"
